<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Farhadifar et al. (2007) Drosophila wing disc apical vertex model & Lewis's law epithelial packing — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions correspond to the Farhadifar vertex energy and Lewis's Law, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_043_drosophila_wing_vertex_model.lean` proves 4 theorems, but v1 docstrings lack equation-by-equation mappings to Farhadifar et al. (2007) Eqs. 1-3 & Figs. 2-4, Gibson et al. (2006), and Classen et al. (2005)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py L32–L150: Baseline functions lack detailed equation-number citations to Farhadifar et al. (2007) Case I/II/III phase diagram and laser ablation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py#L32-L150>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-code-traceability-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Farhadifar et al. (2007) Drosophila wing disc apical vertex model & Lewis's law epithelial packing — Model fidelity to source: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the Farhadifar et al. (2007) Eq. (1)-(2) dimensionless single-cell apical energy (`compute_single_cell_vertex_energy`, L32-52) and Lewis's Law (1928) linear area-side scaling (`lewis_law_ratio`, L55-57), and contrasts proliferating wing disc division disorder against post-mitotic pupal annealing (`simulate_vertex_packing_v1`, L85-150). However, v1 uses centroidal Voronoi relaxation rather than explicit tri-cellular vertex force gradients `-dE/dr_i` with T1 topological edge swaps, omits Case I / II / III ground-state phase boundaries (`Lambda_bar_c(Gamma_bar)`), and omits UV laser ablation junction recoil simulation (Farhadifar et al. 2007 Fig. 4)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py L85–L150: Uses centroidal Voronoi relaxation without explicit vertex gradient forces, Case I/II/III phase diagram, or laser ablation recoil <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py#L85-L150>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Farhadifar et al. (2007) Drosophila wing disc apical vertex model & Lewis's law epithelial packing — Morphometric validation: 54/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes simulated hexagonal fraction `P(6)`, mean side number `<n>`, and theoretical Lewis's law ratio for `n=6` (`measure_morphoeval`, L204-233), but does not compare simulated `P(n)` (`n=4..9`) against Farhadifar et al. (2007) Fig. 4B / Gibson et al. (2006) larval wing disc and Classen et al. (2005) pupal wing distributions via Pearson `r` / RMSE, does not compare `<A_n>/<A>` against Lewis's law across `n=4..9`, and does not segment the biological specimen micrograph to extract empirical cell areas and polygon classes." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py L204–L233: Only 4 basic summary metrics without full n=4..9 P(n) or Lewis's law correlation against reference data and segmented specimen <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py#L204-L233>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-measurement-euler-mean-polygon-side-number>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-measurement-lewis-law-hexagon-normalized-area>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-measurement-pupal-wing-annealed-hexagonal-fraction-p6>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-measurement-wing-disc-proliferating-hexagonal-fraction-p6> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Farhadifar et al. (2007) Drosophila wing disc apical vertex model & Lewis's law epithelial packing — MorphoEval overall 55.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py` (57.7/100). The v1 baseline implements the Farhadifar et al. (2007) dimensionless apical vertex energy functional and simulates 2D periodic Voronoi-vertex relaxation in the proliferating wing disc vs. annealed pupal wing states, but omits analytical ground-state phase diagram classification (Case I rigid hexagonal vs. Case II soft network vs. Case III cell collapse), omits explicit vertex gradient forces -dE/dr_i and simulated UV laser junction ablation recoil kinetics, does not load or segment the vendored apical junction-stained polygonal epithelium specimen (`drosophila_wing_epithelium_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 55.2/100 (faithfulness 50.1, reproducibility 67.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 68, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 46, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 69. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_wing_vertex_model_comparison.png: rendered output of 2007-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model.py at b9976f8, image/png, 209107 B, 1890×588 px, artifact_sha256 ab67d29234ea2884f06a6984e932e052eff44b97176f71f3163ebf00fbc36b62 (sha256 ab67d29234ea2884f06a6984e932e052eff44b97176f71f3163ebf00fbc36b62), spec_fingerprint 00f70e92aaa338b22956554153bb93fbccd372cdaae2e3f47f4744bcadfffe52. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 00f70e92aaa338b22956554153bb93fbccd372cdaae2e3f47f4744bcadfffe52; artifact_sha256: ab67d29234ea2884f06a6984e932e052eff44b97176f71f3163ebf00fbc36b62." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Execute a 7-point continuous parameter sweep across normalized line tension Lambda_bar spanning Case II and Case I, validate Gibson et al. (2006) Markov cleavage and Classen et al. (2005) pupal hexagonal repacking, and expose full CLI flags.",
        "remediation needed: Implement explicit tri-cellular vertex force relaxation (-dE/dr_i) with T1 topological neighbor exchanges, analytical Case I / II / III ground-state phase diagram classification in the (Lambda_bar, Gamma_bar) plane, and simulated UV laser junction ablation recoil velocity profiles across all 4 regimes (Proliferating Wing Disc, Annealed Pupal Wing, High-Contractility Case I, and Soft Case II).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/drosophila_wing_vertex_model/drosophila_wing_vertex_model_reference.json` and `drosophila_wing_epithelium_specimen.jpg`, segment the apical green junction network and nuclear seeds via watershed tessellation to extract empirical polygon classes P(n) and normalized cell areas <A_n>/<A>, and compute Pearson r and RMSE against the vertex model and Lewis's Law." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.52e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Farhadifar et al. (2007) Drosophila wing disc apical vertex model & Lewis's law epithelial packing — Parameter expressivity: 46/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Simulates only a single parameter point `(Lambda_bar=0.12, Gamma_bar=0.04)` in two states (`proliferating=True/False`) without mapping the 2D `(Lambda_bar, Gamma_bar)` ground-state phase diagram across Cases I, II, and III, without a continuous sweep across `Lambda_bar` or `Gamma_bar`, and without CLI flags for `--lambda-bar`, `--gamma-bar`, `--K`, `--A0`, or `--steps` (L243-252)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
